              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anipei kaneni, todung ekapolon Belichasa atamar kitanapae Daniel ngiworui lupusiek-arengak a ekapolon ka erikot a egolit alomosiring. Tolimunoe atamar eliwor Daniel ekapolon lo a nguuni anapolou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.29"
            ]
          }
